OL,3,GNEWSAEnergy bills are rising by #60 a
OL,4,Ayear - here's what you can do about it
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnergy prices have now risen by nearly
OL,7,F4%, with forecasts of a much bigger
OL,8,Fjump to come in January.
OL,10,FIt means a rise of about #60 per year `
OL,11,For #5 per month ` taking an annual bill
OL,12,Fto #1,723 for the typical household
OL,13,Fusing both electricity and gas.
OL,15,FRegulator Ofgem's price cap affects
OL,16,Fabout 20 million households in England,
OL,17,FScotland and Wales and sets a maximum
OL,18,Fprice for each unit of gas and
OL,19,Felectricity.
